WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hiring a trusted realtor from the start is very important to get your property sold.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Here are a few examples.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
181 Meisner Avenue, this homeowner hired two different realtors for way over a year to try to sell the property.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
When they were unsuccessful, the homeowner came to me and I was able to relist for the same price,

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
hire professional photography and enroll the property in paid advertisement,

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
and get over 10 offers within 30 days on the market, selling it for 100% of the list price.

7
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.340
This is 327 Bregaud Avenue in Tottenville, Staten Island.

8
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.340
This homeowner also went through two different realtors.

9
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.340
This homeowner was a bit more savvy.

10
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.340
They noticed the unprofessionalism very early and fired both realtors within 45 days.

11
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:40.340
When the homeowner came to me, I was honest from the start.

12
00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:46.340
I relisted the same price as it was prior and sold it for 96% of the list price within 6 weeks on the market.

13
00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.340
This is 146 David Street.

14
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.340
The homeowner for this property went with the same realtor for over a year.

15
00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.340
The situation with this was a little different.

16
00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:57.340
It was a pre-foreclosure and required a seasoned agent that knew how to negotiate with the banks.

17
00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:02.340
I was able to sell this property within 3 days on the market and got the foreclosure completely satisfied.

18
00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:07.340
Please make sure you hire a trusted realtor from the start to get you the most money for your property.

19
